ta-style="w">our</span> <span class="topos-w" data-strong="G5479" data-style="w">joy</span> may <span class="topos-w" data-strong="G5600" data-style="w">be</span> <span class="topos-w" data-strong="G4137" data-style="w">full</span>.  <span class="topos-verse" data-osis-id="2JN 1:13" data-n="13"></span> The <span class="topos-w" data-strong="G5043" data-style="w">children</span> <span class="topos-w" data-strong="G79" data-style="w">of</span> <span class="topos-w" data-strong="G4675" data-style="w">thy</span> <span class="topos-w" data-strong="G1588" data-style="w">elect</span> <span class="topos-w" data-strong="G79" data-style="w">sister</span> <span class="topos-w" data-strong="G782" data-style="w">greet</span> <span class="topos-w" data-strong="G4571" data-style="w">thee</span>. <span class="topos-w" data-strong="G281" data-style="w">Amen</span>.</p>
