 data-strong="G3029" data-style="w">greatly</span> <span class="w" data-strong="G3754" data-style="w">that</span> I <span class="w" data-strong="G2147" data-style="w">found</span> <span class="w" data-strong="G1537" data-style="w">of</span> <span class="w" data-strong="G4675" data-style="w">thy</span> <span class="w" data-strong="G5043" data-style="w">children</span> <span class="w" data-strong="G4043" data-style="w">walking</span> <span class="w" data-strong="G1722" data-style="w">in</span> <span class="w" data-strong="G225" data-style="w">truth</span>, <span class="w" data-strong="G2531" data-style="w">as</span> we have <span class="w" data-strong="G2983" data-style="w">received</span> a <span class="w" data-strong="G1785" data-style="w">commandment</span> <span class="w" data-strong="G3844" data-style="w">from</span> the <span class="w" data-strong="G3962" data-style="w">Father</span>.  <span class="verse" data-osis-id="2JN 1:5" data-n="5"></span> <span class="w" data-strong="G2532" data-style="w">And</span> <span class="w" data-strong="G3568" data-style="w">now</span> I <span class="w" data-strong="G2065" data-style="w">beseech</span> <span class="w" data-strong="G4571" data-style="w">thee</span>, <span class="w" data-strong="G2959" data-style="w">lady</span>, <span class="w" data-strong="G3756" data-style="w">not</span> <span class="w" data-strong="G5613" data-style="w">as</span> though I <span class="w" data-strong="G1125" data-style="w">wrote</span> a <span class="w" data-strong="G2537" data-style="w">new</span> <span class="w" data-strong="G1785" data-style="w">commandment</span> unto <span class="w" data-strong="G4671" data-style="w">thee</span>, <span class="w" data-strong="G235" data-style="w">but</span> <span class="w" data-strong="G2443" data-style="w">that</span> <span class="w" data-strong="G3739" data-style="w">which</span> we <span class="w" data-strong="G2192" data-style="w">had</span> <span class="w" data-strong="G575" data-style="w">from</span> t